  "title": [
    "[Royal Arboretum, Walkway]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "Vert-colored ivy entwines down the white marble columns framing the cobblestone walkway, the pale pillars affixed with latticed archways draped in the five-pointed leaves.  Thin loops of vaalin wire hang high across the living ceiling, the opalescent hooks suspending colorful origami flora above several glowbark benches carved in whimsical fauna.  Beyond the path sits a number of canopy-covered displays, the artwork framed by tall vases set upon the well-manicured lawn."
  ],
